nsactions":"transactions","impact_balance_lost":"balance lost","time_today":"Today","privacy_policy_effective_date":"Effective: January 1, 2025","privacy_policy_intro":"Masarify is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding your information.","privacy_policy_section_data_collection":"Information We Collect","privacy_policy_data_collection_content":"All financial data you create — accounts, transactions, categories, and currencies — is stored locally on your device by default and never leaves it unless you explicitly enable cloud sync.\n\nIf you create an account and enable cloud sync, we also collect your name and email address to identify your account. No financial data is shared without your explicit opt-in.","privacy_policy_section_data_use":"How We Use Your Information","privacy_policy_data_use_content":"We use your information solely to:\n\n• Provide core finance-tracking features within the app\n• Sync your data across your own devices when you enable cloud sync\n• Send notification reminders you have opted into\n• Maintain your account and process subscription payments","privacy_policy_section_data_storage":"Data Storage & Security","privacy_policy_data_storage_content":"Local data is stored in an encrypted SQLite database on your device. Cloud-synced data is transmitted over TLS and stored encrypted at rest (AES-256) on our servers. We never sell, rent, or share your personal or financial data with third parties for advertising or any other commercial purpose.","privacy_policy_section_third_party":"Third-Party Services","privacy_policy_third_party_content":"Masarify uses the following services, each governed by its own privacy policy:\n\n• Firebase (Google) — authentication, push notifications, and remote configuration\n• RevenueCat — subscription management and purchase verification\n• Apple App Store / Google Play Store — payment processing for Pro subscriptions\n\nThese services may collect device identifiers and usage signals as described in their respective policies.","privacy_policy_section_your_rights":"Your Rights","privacy_policy_your_rights_content":"You may at any time:\n\n• Export all your data via More → Backup & Restore\n• Delete your cloud account and all associated server-side data by contacting us\n• Use the app in local-only (guest) mode with no data ever leaving your device\n• Disable notifications in the app settings","privacy_policy_section_contact":"Contact","privacy_policy_contact_content":"Questions about this policy or your data? Reach us at:\n\nprivacy@masarify.app","fab_menu":"Menu","fab_add_transaction":"Add Transaction","income_breakdown":"Income breakdown","exchange_rate":"Exchange Rate","exchange_rate_invalid":"Enter a valid exchange rate","received_amount":"You'll receive: {0} {1}","save_transaction":"Save Transaction","post_transaction":"Post Transaction","transaction_amount_label":"Transaction Amount","deposit_to":"Deposit To","notes":"Notes","enter_notes":"Write a note…","tap_to_change":"Tap to change","select_account":"Select account","currency_berkshire":"Berkshire Hathaway","currency_berkshire_desc":"Berkshire Hathaway Class B stock","currency_jpmorgan":"JPMorgan Chase","currency_jpmorgan_desc":"JPMorgan Chase & Co. stock","currency_visa":"Visa Inc.","currency_visa_desc":"Visa Inc. stock","currency_cib_egypt":"CIB Egypt","currency_cib_egypt_desc":"Commercial International Bank Egypt ADR","currency_oih":"VanEck Oil Services","currency_oih_desc":"VanEck Oil Services ETF","auto_sync_rates":"Auto sync transaction rates","auto_sync_rates_description":"Automatically sync exchange rates on app launch","auto_sync_rates_enabled":"Auto sync enabled","auto_sync_rates_disabled":"Auto sync disabled","auto_sync_rates_banner":"Rates are auto-synced. Turn off Auto sync in Settings to edit manually. ","data":"Data","add_transaction_cta":"Add transaction","fix_balance_action":"Fix Balance","backup_restore":"Backup & Resto